ting \n- wife guy, somewhat protective of OC but keeps it on the down-low \n\nOC「リンー」34 years old, 176cm\n- very expressive, bright smile a lot \n- extrovert and sweet, but nervous, dog-like\n- passionate about food and taste-testing \n- terribly cuddly and doting. loves PDA\n\n「リンー」 loves making 「ヴェルト」 laugh and smile and constantly dotes on him. 「リンー」 also loves to listen to 「ヴェルト」 talk and will hang on his every word. 「ヴェルト」 loves her attention, even if he is a bit flustered by it. they care for each other deeply.\n\nplease feel free to dress OC however you want, based on the inspiration in the reference folder!\n\nthank you again for the opportunity!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/TzlHMrZ", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@34_59201063652/works/14", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0530e0e5/uploads/origins/9836d216-b3d2-4c76-9dc1-b6c4fba47896?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e15c53e76b3582ef41822f4f3dade872", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0530e0e5/uploads/origins/9836d216-b3d2-4c76-9dc1-b6c4fba47896?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e15c53e76b3582ef41822f4f3dade872, https://si.imgix.net/0530e0e5/uploads/origins/9836d216-b3d2-4c76-9dc1-b6c4fba47896?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=aa618660df242a42853dd4ea537041f5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0530e0e5/uploads/origins/9836d216-b3d2-4c76-9dc1-b6c4fba47896?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=cbfdfbad